Third-party code and derived files

third_party/mrmeows_planners/
  Kernel planners by mrmeows (team selenium), copied unchanged from the Kaggle dataset
  "QCC open circuits and sources" (mrmeows/qcc-1375-open-circuits). Apache License, Version 2.0.

dqi/hybrid_g892.py
  A modified version of external_node_chain from the q18 DQI source of Agniv Banerjee (SomeJoint)
  and team (Apache License, Version 2.0), starting from the hybrid6 carry version built by ahoirg's
  portable builder, which adapts yoyobar's one-carry patch. Changes by us: the group-6 pole flag is
  measured in the forward pass and recomputed in the reverse of node 7; the carry bank starts at
  group 9; the carry zero tests take a per-group number of marker bits.

dqi/patches/g892.json, dqi/build_dqi_g892.patch
  Edits applied at build time to files of the source bundle in ahoirg's dataset
  "QCC Reproducible Circuit Assets" (ahoirg/qcc-reproducible-circuit-assets) and to its
  build_dqi.py. They quote short context lines of those files. The bundle and the build
  script themselves are not redistributed here.

Inputs that are not included
  Competition data (kickmix, verifiers), the DQI source bundle, the invsqrt circuit and the
  C40 chemistry table keep their authors' terms. See README.md for their sources and SHA-256.
